# handlePaid's Greatest<measure> over a Count$Valid list (AbilityUtils.java:
# 3835-3850): Essence Harvest's `X:Count$Valid Creature.YouCtrl$GreatestCardPower`
# is the greatest power among the caster's own creatures -- the Hill Giant's 3,
# not the Bears' 2 and not the opponent's 6/6 Dreadmaw. Read as the spell
# resolves, outside a layer pass, so live power is measured. The target loses
# 3 and the caster gains 3.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
queue paygeneric B
queue paygeneric B
queue targets ai
castspell human 1
resolvestack
